OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GThe young ensemble performs
OL,6,     Gstring quartets by Haydn, Kui
OL,7,     GDong and Schumann in this concert
OL,8,     Gfrom Barcelona. The programme
OL,9,     Gincludes Haydn's famously
OL,10,     Ghumorous quartet 'The Joke.'.
